{1}{Thank the gods you are here, @pcname@! You must have received word from my father. [She sees the puzzled look on your face.] Some strange magick has transformed me into a wolf. I assure you that I am Samantha, daughter of your friend Fernando.}{Thank the gods you are here, @pcname@! You must have received word from my father. [She sees the puzzled look on your face.] Some strange magick has transformed me into a wolf. I assure you that I am Samantha, daughter of your friend Fernando.}{}{}{}{lf1 1, pf1 1, gf2 1 }
