{20}{I do not know. He was gone when I awoke in this form, a fortnight ago. Strange things had been transpiring around here, people were disappearing at an alarming rate, and...}{I do not know. He was gone when I awoke in this form, a fortnight ago. Strange things had been transpiring around here, people were disappearing at an alarming rate, and...}{}{}{}{ }
