{30}{Of course, of course. About a year ago, people began disappearing from the village, about one or two a month. The local mage informed the town council that evil magick had begun emanating from the castle, so a group of volunteers were sent to investigate. They never returned.}{Of course, of course. About a year ago, people began disappearing from the village, about one or two a month. The local mage informed the town council that evil magick had begun emanating from the castle, so a group of volunteers were sent to investigate. They never returned.}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{And then?}{}{5}{}{40}{ }
{32}{Hurgh?}{}{-4}{}{40}{ }
{40}{We became as a town under siege. We tried defending ourselves, to no avail. The dead ones began coming in the night, dragging off more and more villagers. The last of the town leaders decided on one last assault upon the castle to try and end this horror. I was to go with them, but when I awoke that morning they were gone and I had been transformed.}{We became as a town under siege. We tried defending ourselves, to no avail. The dead ones began coming in the night, dragging off more and more villagers. The last of the town leaders decided on one last assault upon the castle to try and end this horror. I was to go with them, but when I awoke that morning they were gone and I had been transformed.}{}{}{}{qu1000 1 }
